WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.563
VISION
Wanda?

00:00:01.563 --> 00:00:02.469
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Hmm?

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.997
VISION
Is there something special about today?

00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:07.188
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well, I know the apron is a bit much dear,

00:00:07.188 --> 00:00:09.072
but I am doing my
best to blend in.

00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:09.875
[Laughter]

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:11.031
VISION
No, no, there on the calendar.

00:00:11.031 --> 00:00:15.808
Someone’s drawn a little heart
right above today’s date.

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:17.000
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Oh yes, the heart.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.268
VISION
Hmm...

00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:20.909
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well don’t tell me you’ve forgotten, Vis?

00:00:20.863 --> 00:00:22.777
VISION
Forgotten? Oh Wanda, I’m incapable

00:00:22.777 --> 00:00:25.300
of forgetfulness. I remember everything,
and that’s not an exaggeration.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.187
In fact, I’m incapable
of exaggeration.

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:29.698
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well then tell me what’s so important

00:00:29.698 --> 00:00:30.965
about today’s date?

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:33.425
[Laughter]

00:00:33.425 --> 00:00:35.055
VISION
What was the question again?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.634
Oh well, perhaps you
have forgotten yourself.

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:37.705
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Me? Heavens no!

00:00:37.705 --> 00:00:39.773
I’ve been so looking
forward to it.

00:00:39.978 --> 00:00:43.306
VISION
As have I! Today, we’re celebrating...

00:00:43.306 --> 00:00:47.250
WANDA MAXIMOFF
You bet we are. It’s the first time we...

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.289
VISION
Mmhmm...

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:49.781
WANDA MAXIMOFF
...have ever celebrated

00:00:49.781 --> 00:00:51.250
this occasion before.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.900
VISION
It’s a special day!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.033
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Perhaps an evening.

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:54.902
VISION
Of great significance.

00:00:54.902 --> 00:00:55.430
WANDA MAXIMOFF
To us both.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.078
VISION
Naturally.

00:00:56.078 --> 00:00:56.703
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Obviously.

00:00:56.703 --> 00:00:57.570
VISION
Exactly.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.517
[Laughter]

00:00:58.517 --> 00:00:59.434
VISION
Well done us.

